<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on SGS.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets call warrants on SGS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch Capital Markets AG says it has issued three million American-style call warrants, on Societe Generale de Surveillance Holding SA.</p>
<p>100 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    3,200.00 SFR	    PREMIUM	14.65 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     4.00 SFR		  GEARING	7.85 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 31.DEC.96-31.JUL.98   PAYDATE	30.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWISS SE		  MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  3,140.00 SFR</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
